BEHAVIOR make-connect-addr

DESCRIPTION
  Builds a sockaddr_in for connecting to 127.0.0.1:9755.
  16 bytes: family(2), port(big-endian 9755=0x261B), IP(127.0.0.1).

CONTRACT
  OUTPUT addr bytes 128
  OUTPUT addr_len int 8
  GUARANTEES writes_output

HASH 25b33dd7

IMPLEMENTATION
  STORE addr 2 1 0
  STORE addr 0 1 1
  STORE addr 38 1 2
  STORE addr 27 1 3
  STORE addr 127 1 4
  STORE addr 0 1 5
  STORE addr 0 1 6
  STORE addr 1 1 7
  STORE addr 0 1 8
  STORE addr 0 1 9
  STORE addr 0 1 10
  STORE addr 0 1 11
  STORE addr 0 1 12
  STORE addr 0 1 13
  STORE addr 0 1 14
  STORE addr 0 1 15
  STORE addr_len 16 8
END
